          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0d2550' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>Key finding:</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1a3a6b' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'> Overall sales exceeded budget by </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0d2550' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>+$73,651 (+9.9%)</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1a3a6b' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>, but profit beat budget by only +$783 (+0.3%) — indicating higher-than-expected costs. The </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0d2550' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>South region</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1a3a6b' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'> missed profit budget by $2,562 and is the only market to underperform. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0d2550' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>West</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1a3a6b' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'> exceeded sales budget by $32,564 but profit came in slightly under (−$364).</run>
          </formatted-text>
