            <run fontcolor='#1a3a6b' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'> is the only product operating at a net loss (−$231). Espresso products show the widest profit spread — Decaf Espresso performs well (+$29,502) while Caffe Mocha underperforms relative to sales volume.</run>
