            <run fontcolor='#1a3a6b' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'> leads in total sales ($272K) but Central leads in total profit ($93K) — West&apos;s higher costs reduce profitability. </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0d2550' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>South</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1a3a6b' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'> is the weakest region overall, and is the only market with a profit budget miss (−$2,562). </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0d2550' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>California</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1a3a6b' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'> and </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0d2550' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'>Illinois</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1a3a6b' fontname='-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,sans-serif' fontsize='11'> are the top two states by profit.</run>
